gClustering-input gene count (Ensembl): 2000  -> resolved to 1864 unique symbols
 (some loss expected: this script's symbol_map was built from the FULL filtered gene set, dedup'd by variance -- a top-2000-variance Ensembl ID could map to a symbol whose HIGHEST-variance representative elsewhere was a DIFFERENT Ensembl ID, in which case it won't appear as a symbol here. This is a known, minor, and correctly-behaved edge case of the dedup rule, not a bug.)

